# [OPENPGP](../wg/openpgp.html)

## Summary

The OpenPGP Working Group met to discuss active working group documents, protocol updates, interop testing, and potential work items. Key items addressed included multi-target 2nd-preimage attacks affecting post-quantum composite signatures, registry cleanups for external secret keys, update status for key replacement and HTTP Keyserver Protocol (HKP), command-line updates to Stateless OpenPGP (SOP), and persistent symmetric keys (PSK). The working group agreed to return the NIST and Brainpool composite document to working group last call (WGLC) following updates to digest size requirements.

